    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etudung'oko Olaitoriani enkiguana eomonoto oo nkaitin nemeishu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enatii; naajoki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, intorioki enkomom ino enkalo oo ldoinyio le Israel, nimbonoki agilunore ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nijo: intae lo doinyio le Israel, entoning ororei lo Laitoriani Enkai! Inji ejoki Olaitoriani Enkai ildoinyio o ndoinyo, o lashepak o nong'ot: ing'ura, ore nanu enkewan ai naa kayau olalem shumata intae, naar ainyal iwuejitin inyi neeika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilpereren linyi naa keaku mijoonto ore ilpereren le nkorropil inyi naa kegili; ore lelo linyi ootaraki metuata nanang'aa ninche te dukuya inkitanyaanyukot inyi oo nkaitin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kairragie lelo seseni ootuata loo ltung'ana le Israel te dukuya inkitanyaanyukot enye oo nkaitin nemeishu; naidapash iloik linyi aitaman ilpereren linyi loo lasarri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki nimanyimanya naa keaku nkanas inyi mijoonto nemuti iwuejitin inyi neeika, metaa ore ilpereren linyi loo lasarri neaku ile pesho netumutaki, negili aabelibel inkitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin inyi nemeishu, nedung'i ilpereren linyi le nkorropil aauroo, nejutori isiaaitin inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebatatakino ilkumok ootuata atua intae, niyiolouu aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa kaleku ilkuti linyi eishu. Neaku iatata too loshon ilekunot ooilanya ilo alem, naa teneidapashi intae too nkuapi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku ore lelo linyi ooilanyishote naadamu nanu te lelo oshon oowaita ninche aitaa iyarunot, ina kata atigila iltauja lenye lemaairuk naaing'uaa nanu, naitamodok inkonyek enye nena naaibelekenyakinote to lng'uarra nena kitanyaanyukot enye oo nkaitin; naa keibayu te nduaata enye maate nena torrok naataasa, o lminong lenye pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keyiolou ina kata aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani; eitu airo te mpesho inchere kaitaas ena torrono ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: “Entoosh inkaik inyi, nioshieshie nkejek inyi enkop nijojo, Aha! Ore enkaraki ina bae olminong le nkaji e Israel; amu kebatata ninche to lalem, o lameyu, o lmeitai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo olakua oleng naa keye to lmeitai; ore ilo otaana nebatatakino olalem; ore ilo otelekua neitajeuoki naa keye to lameyu. Neaku neijia aikunaki engoro ai napi ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyiolouu aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani, ina kata eirragaa impopoki enye tiatua inkitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin enye nemeishu emanita ilpereren lenye, te shumata pooki doinyo oodo, o too nchumat pooki oo ldoinyo, o tiabori olchani pooki onyori, o tiabori pooki shani dapashi mbenek, o te pooki wueji ake neitainye esong'uana narropil aaitaiki inkitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin enye nemeishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitorioo enkaina ai agilunore ninche, naitaa enkop mitil naitomijoon, too manyishoritin enye pooki, eiteru to lpurkel o meshomo Ribla. Ina kata eyiolou ninche aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
